# Agent/session local state
.claude/

/flutter/qwen_asr/rust/target

# Flutter / FRB generated files (Rust side)
# NOTE: /flutter/qwen_asr/rust/src/frb_generated.rs is deliberately NOT ignored.
# It is excluded from `CrateHash` only if absent — but it IS present in the CI
# checkout when `build_tool precompile-binaries` computes the crate hash, so it
# must also be present in the published pub archive (generated there by the same
# codegen step) or the consumer-side hash will never match the precompiled
# binaries release. It stays untracked; do not commit it.

# NOTE: the Dart-side FRB bindings (/flutter/qwen_asr/lib/src/rust/frb_generated*.dart)
# are deliberately NOT ignored here. `dart pub publish` excludes git-ignored files
# from the package archive, and publish-flutter.yml generates these bindings in CI
# right before publishing — ignoring them ships a package whose lib/ does not
# compile (see the pub.dev pana report: "Target of URI doesn't exist:
# 'rust/frb_generated.dart'"). They stay untracked; do not commit them (they are
# regenerated by flutter_rust_bridge_codegen).
